{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"\"When I had amara with me. It was lonely in prison. I think thats where the closed off came from. Its hard to trust and open up to people when they are the ones that put you there.\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T18:14:21.177000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741358588089335900","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
