{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"\"Amara saw darkness in me the last time I got out. She was afraid I would block her out too. It was her idea to come here......\" she trails off a little. \"I think i saw it to but didn't want to acknowledge it. I have never had anyone be nice to me the way everyone....the way you have been. Its slow but I'm learning. With your help I know i can open up to everyone.\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T18:34:12.196000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741363583585222814","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
